    q: "You've signed the PSA. Walk me through what happens between now and closing.",
    a: "Fund the deposit and order the third-party reports: property condition, Phase I, survey, title and zoning. Audit the leases and financials and get estoppels out to tenants. Apply for the loan in parallel so the appraisal and loan documents keep pace. Update the model with every finding, then go back to IC before diligence expires: waive, renegotiate or terminate. Finally, clear title, collect estoppels, agree the closing statement, fund and record the deed.",
